Now update renderTechniques passive cards and sidebar to show requirements and base qi. Need edit carefully.

Current block:
```
} else {
      const cards = techniques.map(t => {
        const level = state.upgrades[t.id] || 0, cost = Math.ceil(t.base * Math.pow(level + 1, 1.55));
