```
Change to include req and cannot-train. Use `<span class="stat-pill ...">` maybe. Card layout may handle. We'll add small-note beneath tech-level:
```
const locked = state.stage < t.req;
const can = !locked && state.stones >= cost;
...
<div class="tech-level">RANK ${level} · ${t.effect}${locked ? ` · STAGE ${t.req} REQUIRED` : ''}</div>
...
<button ... ${can ? '' : 'disabled'}>${locked ? 'Locked' : 'Attune'}<span>${locked ? `Stage ${t.req}` : `◇ ${cost}`}</span></button>
```
Button width with two lines. Good. Add note in panel header: "Sutras unlock as your realm advances: stage 2, 3, 5, 6, 8 and 10." Maybe generic.

Sidebar feature stats add base qi. Current:
```
<div class="feature-stats"><span>QI FLOW <b>${rateFor().toFixed(1)} / sec</b></span><span>BREAKTHROUGH <b>${breakChance()}%</b></span><span>ARTS LEARNED <b>${state.activeArts.length} / ${martialArts.length}</b></span></div>
```
Add `<span>BASE QI <b>${qiBase().toFixed(1)} / sec</b></span>` (4 items may wrap but okay; feature-stats flex can wrap? CSS no wrap. It might overflow on narrow aside. We can replace "ARTS LEARNED" with base or add as fourth, but 4 items ~ 4*70px = 280px, aside width ~270px, could overflow. Use `flex-wrap:wrap`? `.feature-stats` currently display flex gap 16. Add CSS `flex-wrap:wrap` to `.feature-stats` globally? That could affect layout but likely fine. Alternatively add base to the paragraph: "Your breath gathers X qi each second (base Y)." That avoids new stat. Do that:
- Active: `Your breath gathers ${rateFor().toFixed(1)} qi each second (${qiBase().toFixed(1)} base before bonuses).`
- Inactive similar. That's explicit.

Paths foundation stats add base qi; currently 5 items. Adding sixth could wrap; use paragraph instead. Maybe change `<span>QI FLOW <b>...` to include base: `<span>QI FLOW <b>${rateFor().toFixed(1)} / sec</b> (base ${qiBase().toFixed(1)})</span>` but b inside. Fine:
`<span>QI FLOW <b>${rateFor().toFixed(1)} / sec</b><br>BASE ${qiBase().toFixed(1)}</span>` could be okay but feature-stats line height. Simpler: add a small note under the foundation card:
Currently path-note has paragraph and feature-stats. Add:
`<p class="small-note">Base qi growth: ${qiBase().toFixed(1)} qi/sec at stage ${state.stage}. Each realm and rank of the Clear Heart Sutra adds more.</p>`
That's clear.

Update `render` to show base in qi rate title maybe:
```
const rateEl = $('qiRate');
if (rateEl) { rateEl.textContent = rateFor().toFixed(1); rateEl.title = `Base ${qiBase().toFixed(1)} qi/sec before bonuses`; }
```
Replace `aid('qiRate', ...)`.

Also update `meditateLabel` hint maybe mention rate? no.

Now patch renderTechniques.

